<title>JAPAN: Innotech - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Innotech - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.55		vs	   16.78</p>
<p> Operating	  858    million	  vs	  763    million</p>
<p> Current	    815    million	  vs	  615    million</p>
<p> Net		  499    million	  vs	  337    million</p>
<p> EPS		   37.82 yen	  vs	   26.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Innotech Corp is an importer of semiconductor-related products.</p>
